  # Signature: heat+n energy-n pcr-n; age+reserve+thr+sp+pmf held — mix life-force.
  # Usability: AGI models post-pore vesicle content mix under ASSERT.
  # Returns take mixed; dead/n<1/empty atp|energy|pcr -> 0.
  METHOD mix n
    GETF THIS alive
    IF LAST_N == 0 THEN
